InStaLLAtioN
~~~~~~~~~~~~
Simply follow these steps:

1. The door MUST be in a dir called DWALL located in DOORS:

2. Move all files doors:Dwall/

3. Create a file called bad.dat that contains words you
   dont want the user to be able to use :)

4. Create a file called banned.dat that contains user
   handles that you want banned from using the wall.

5. Create a file called key.dat that has two lines:
   The first should be your Sysop name/handle
   The second should be tge BBS name
   Save it to the doors:dwall/ directory

6. Put in your Welcome.gfx

       ÿdoors:dwall/dwall %N

Or put it in your config file as a Daydream Door:

	DOOR_COMMAND.. DWALL
	DOOR_TYPE..... 1
	DOOR_SECURITY. 5
	DOOR_EXECUTE.. doors:dwall/dwall %N
	DOOR_CONFS1... XXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXX
	DOOR_CONFS2... XXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXX


7. Edit the file Dwall.cfg
   At the moment there are only two options:
             Line 1    16 or 8 colour console
             Line 2    Default Menu position Y or N

Edit the Wall.ansi and newline.ansi for your own style
(I would appreciate ANYONE sending me some better ANSIs!)

Thats it!



N.B. THE SYSOP MENU ITEM DOES NOT DO ANYTHING YET! ITS NOT
     A BUG!



             -----~~~~~ HISTORY ~~~~~-----

Features:
~~~~~~~~~
°Running Top authors list displayed
°Centred Text
°Bi - Coloured Text   *NEW*
°Who Function to show athors of lines
°Auto Creates all files except bad.dat
°Sysop can create own ANSI's
°Sysop can Ban Words
°Sysop can ban Users!

